window.products.push({"id":1035024,"name":"Gravity Electric Pepper and Salt Grinder Set- Automatic Pepper Grinder ，Adjustable Coarseness, Battery Powered with LED Light, One Hand Automatic Oper","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TfrVP2ZCS._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"☘【UNIQUE DESIGN & BATTERY POWERED】:This electric gravity pepper grinder allow you will not need both of your hands to grind your spices. No button! Simply flipped the pepper grinder mill and you will have fresh ground spices! Convenient and funny. Each grinder requires 6 AAA batteries (batteries not included but included small brush for cleaning). ☘【BLUE LED LIGHT & TRANSPARENT CONTAINER】:When flipping the salt and pepper grinders, there will be a blue automatic led light, you can easily see the amount of salt and pepper put in the food. The transparent Acrylic like glass allows you to see the amount remaining in the grinder. Blue light is not only bright but also soft. You can't imagine how warm and romantic it would be to have dinner with your family or lover. ☘【ADJUSTABLE GRIND COARSENESS】:Electric pepper mill with adjustable grinder, just flip the automatic grinder and you will get fresh ground spices! And you can adjust the grinding knob on the top of the device to choose the roughness of your favorite spice, salt or pepper. And this salt and pepper mill has a wide mouth large spice container by transparent Acrylic. ☘【FREE WOODEN STAND】: The wooden stand is specially designed for this particular electric grinder set and it is durable and easy to clean. It prevent your counter top from getting messy and makes it easier for you to move the grinders around. The stand makes the appearance of the electric salt and pepper mill more perfect. Dispensing freshly ground salt and pepper has never been easier. ☘【SATISFACTION GUARANTEE】: We are confident of our product and our electric salt and pepper mills are backed by a 30 day money back guarantee and one year replacement warranty. Feel free to email us if you have any questions, we promise to solve your problems within 24 hours. NOTE: Corrosive products such as salt cannot be placed in the battery parts to prevent damage. And sometimes powder may block the powder outlet, please shake it a few times before using.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TfrVP2ZCS._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Carfeel","source_asin":"B093G72NHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035024","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B093G72NHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B093G72NHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
