window.products.push({"id":1035266,"name":"Fdit Stainless Steel Car Electric Kettle Heating Mug for Traveling (750ml)(12V)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.78,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XIIQ+IMaL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Specification: Condition: 100% Brand New Material: Stainless Steel Voltage: 12V, 24V (optional) Power: 240W Capacity: 750ml Product Size: Approx. 85 x 85 x 216 mm / 3.3 x 3.3 x 8.5 in Weight: Approx. 576g / 20.3 oz  Instruction: Fill the water, cover the lid, and insert the cigarette lighter plug into the car cigarette lighter socket. The red indicator light will start to heat up, after heating to 100 degrees, it will automatically power off for heat preservation, and the green indicator light will be on.  Package List: 1 x Electric Kettle 1 x User Manual  Note: 1. Before using the kettle, please dry clean (the inside of the cup can be washed), do not wet the electrical components to prevent short circuit and damage. 2. Only use the specified power supply, that is, distinguish between 12V and 24V. It is forbidden to mix. 3. Do not heat when there is no water inside the cup, the electric heating tube should be completely immersed in the water. 4. The water level should not be higher than the stainless steel body to avoid overfilling. 5. After boiling, unplug the power, then press the switch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XIIQ+IMaL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fdit","source_asin":"B07YD413FV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YD413FV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YD413FV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
