window.products.push({"id":1035348,"name":"48Pcs Regular Mouth Canning Lids and Rings Mason jar lids Reusable Leak Proof Split-Type Silver Lids with Silicone Seals Rings (70mm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S5WzmqmoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧂 【Good Sealing - Leak-proof & Airtight】: Our Mason Jar Canning Lids is equipped with a silicone ring, The silicone sealing ring inside the jar lid makes the mason canning jar lids have good sealing performance. It can keep the food, grains, seasonings, beverages fresh. You need not worry about leaking sealing materials contaminate the kitchen or other places. 🧂 【Premium Safety Material - ANTI-RUST EFFECT】: Our Canning Lids and Rings are not easy to rust. BPA free. Food grade-high temperature resistance up to 240 ° F. It can be put in the dishwasher, freezer refrigerator and dry storage. You could use it for food storage, or bath canning, pressure canning as well. 🧂 【Split-Type Design - Easy to Use】: The bands can be applied in combination with silicone fermenting lids and sprouting lids, the screw thread on the bottle mouth can increase the friction force of hands, which facilitates the opening of the bottle. The Split-Type canned Lids and rings can be replaced individually, which is more economical. 🧂 【Wide Applications】: These mason jar lids and rings Suitable for sealing the regular mouth mason canning jars that stored spices, sweets, biscuits, fruits, jams, soft drinks, tea or coffee, nails, screws and other small objects. 🧂 【Value Pack- Canning Lids and Rings Regular Mouth】: 48pcs Silver Mason Jar Canning Lids and Rings - Include 24 pcs regular mouth mason canning jar lids & 24 pcs bands. You will get an adequate quantity for you to use, replace and sharing with your family or friends. Size : 2.76 inches/ 70mm in diameter. Mason Jar Canning Lids can be compatible with the most regular mouth of 70mm mason jar, cannot be compatible with other wide-mouth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81S5WzmqmoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DUOQIAN","source_asin":"B0BMPZZWRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMPZZWRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMPZZWRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
