window.products.push({"id":1035370,"name":"Silicone Cooking Spoons, Heat Resistant Large Silicone Pasta Slotted Spoon Solid Basting Spoon set for Nonstick Cookware, BPA Free Black Kitchen Silic","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zbjsmAK4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Package content: this package includes 1 piece large silicone spoon, 1 piece skimmer spoon and 1 piece pasta server in black color, classic and vibrant. The silicone spoon measures approx. 27.5 x 6 cm, slotted spoon measures approx. 27.5 x 6 cm, pasta server measures approx. 29 x 5.5 cm to meet your different needs in the kitchen. It is a perfect gift for anyone who loves cooking, perfect for Mother's and Father's Day, birthday gifts, housewarming gifts and more. Durable and non-stick material: this silicone non-stick kitchen utensils set is made of food-grade silicone, environmentally friendly, non-toxic, BPA-free and durable, easy to clean. Silicone heads cannot scratch or damage non-stick cooking pots, pans and woks like metals, ensure a long daily use without breaking cookware. Most silicone handles do not melt when we leave them on the edge of a hot pan. High Heat Resistant:This flexible silicone spoon set has heat resistant properties, can withstand temperatures up to 230°C/446°F and bring you more safety and convenience. Silicone non-stick spoon set can be used for cooking, baking, tasting and serving food etc. Each silicone spoon can withstand high heat and does not melt or curl easily in hot oil and water, safe in non-stick pans and coated cookware. Practical Grip Design:Ergonomic handle provides comfortable, non-slip grip, strong yet flexible with a long and non-slip grip part for a safe grip experience. Great heat insulating silicone handle can protect your hands from scalding. This silicone spoon has a convenient hole at the top for convenient storage with hook or wall mount that can be cleaned and hung when not in use without taking up much space. Satisfied Guarantee & Dishwasher Safe: If in doubt, feel free to let us know. Thank you for your trust and your care. Please wash the silicone spoons with soap and hot water before first use. And you can just put them in the dishwasher or hand wash them after use. Ideal for home kitchen, dining room or party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zbjsmAK4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Thimmamma","source_asin":"B0BDRQX6GY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035370","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDRQX6GY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDRQX6GY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
