window.products.push({"id":1035430,"name":"GUANYIHAN Blue Shower Curtain, Leaf Shower Curtain with 12 Hooks, Thickened Waterproof Fabric Shower Curtain for Classic and Modern Bathrooms, 71 x 71","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.66,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E4yDmYjpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌹Shower in your own space: When you step under the warm, soothing shower head, it's extra delightful when your surroundings are spotless too. Your fabric shower curtain should be odor-free and water-tight, keeping the mist where it should be. We offer you this 71 x 71 inch classic shower curtain, this extra thick shower curtain will fit perfectly in either a classically designed bathroom or a modern designed bathroom. 🌹Protect precious bathroom decorations: Beautiful bathroom decorations such as fabric exterior curtains, wall art and your bathroom appliances will last longer when they are protected from leaks, exposure to stray water mist. When your blue leaf shower curtain is firmly in place, be sure that the shower spray will stay in place. 12 carefully crafted grommets are securely fastened from above to keep the shower curtain from sliding around while you shower and shower. 🌹Make sure you walk out without slipping: With this thick shower curtain, there is no need to worry about the water splashing on the floor when you shower. A puddle on the bathroom floor is less than ideal and creates extra work - no one wants to clean up a mess after a relaxing shower. Reliable, durable polyester shower curtains are the best choice for keeping your tiles, floors, carpets dry. 🌹Easy to clean: To make sure your shower curtain is as healthy as possible and easy to maintain, we pay attention to using thick polyester waterproof fabric combined with digital printing technology to make sure it is safe for all ages, it has no odor and the pattern is more vivid and real . This long-lasting barrier is also tear-resistant to ensure years of waterproofing. And you can use the washing machine to clean the shower curtain. When the shower curtain is used for a long time, you can even iron the shower curtain to make it flat again, which is impossible for plastic shower curtains. 🌹Putting you first: Customer satisfaction is our most important task. If you have any questions or concerns, we won't sneak away, so feel free to contact us - we're here for you. Trust us to provide you with exceptional home essentials to meet your needs, knowing that we go to great lengths to provide you with every product of the highest quality, design and durability.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81E4yDmYjpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GUANYIHAN","source_asin":"B0B1MHY3LJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1MHY3LJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1MHY3LJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
