window.products.push({"id":1035536,"name":"Meat Thermometer, Instant Read Food Thermometer for Cooking, Waterproof Digital Kitchen Thermometer with Backlight, Ultra Fast Cooking Thermometer Lon","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mYsejI33L._SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ultra Fast & Accurate Reading】Maliton Instant read food thermometer owns food grade probes and ultra-thin & sensitive 1.5mm diameter pointed head probes, can get quick measurements off food in 2-3 second, which is accurate temperature to +/-1 ℉. Additionally, the probe can withstand temp from -58°F to 572°F (-50°C to 300°C), to eliminate all guesswork of Kitchen, Whether to fry beef steaks, grill pork, deep fry potatoes, or BBQ. 【Upgrade Dual Probe】 Different from the traditional meat thermometer probe design, our oven thermometer equipped with dual probe design, external wired OVEN SAFE probe makes it measure the temp of food in the oven in real-time, without having to open the oven while cooking. 【Five Temp Option Setting & Alarm Set For Easy To Use】 Different from other cooking thermometer, Maliton kitchen thermometer has five temp settings, including lamb, beef, turkey, chicken and other temperature setting options. With the use of alarm function, the \"beep\" will work great to alert you once the food temperature reaches the set value.A good help for you to control temp of food. 【IP67 Waterproof for Easy To Clean】 The whole body of our digital meat thermometer is designed to be IP67 waterproof. Which allow it can be washed under running water without worry. Also, not worry that food's steam would destroy food thermometer. Wow~ Please enjoy your summer bbq grill with maliton bbq thermometer. 【Multil Features for Easy To Use】 Maliton cooking thermometer is compact with mutil features for your handy use. ① Big LCD makes you read temp easily in poor light.② Twice capacitance of other thermometer, lasting longer. ③ The magnet on back, making it put on the fridge near the stove for instant use. ④ It can be calibrated. ⑤ An opener designed in the hanging hole.⑥ You will get an extra bonus refrigerator thermometer, matching with Maliton digital meat thermometer is perfect for your cooking.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mYsejI33L._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Maliton","source_asin":"B08R9K8LZZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035536","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08R9K8LZZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08R9K8LZZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
