window.products.push({"id":1035688,"name":"6 Inch Queen Size Accu-Gold 5.3 Visco Elastic Memory Foam Mattress Bed","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":739.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+8sQqVPzL._AC_.jpg","description":"The 6 Inch Accu-Gold 5.3 sleep system includes one 4 inch layer of Accu-Flex medium firm conventional posture sense base and one 2 inch layer of Accu-Gold 5.3 visco elastic memory. Accu-Gold 5.3 has been developed as the unique, new state of the art visco elastic memory foam. For those of you looking for higher quality, better performance, and a premium comfort we have utilized Accu-Gold 5.3 in our line up. The finest visco elastic memory foam in the bedding market today is Accutex Foam USA family of products. The Accutex Gold Formula is custom engineered for the ultimate performance offered by any visco elastic memory foam for superior support and pressure relieving comfort that will out perform any visco elastic memory foam product you may have considered before. Accu-Gold provides pressure point relief and support that is beyond the realm of other visco elastic memory foam products. Accu-Gold will provide you with superior pressure point relief not found in other visco elastic memory foam products on the bedding market today. The most problematic pressure points, such as your hips and shoulders, received up to an 80% percent reduction in pressure fatigue when compared in side by side tests with competing bedding and mattress products. The Accu-Gold difference is in the engineering. Accu-Gold has been designed with an open cell structure; therefore, air flows through the golden struts at a higher rate than other visco elastic memory foams on the market today. This will cause excess heat and moisture to be wicked away which will equate to even less discomfort and fatigue caused by older visco elastic memory foam products. Accu-Gold is more supportive and will make you feel like you are floating in a sea of liquid gold. All Accutex Foam USA memory foam mattresses are made using visco elastic memory foam produced in the USA.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51+8sQqVPzL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Accu-Gold 5.3 Memory Foam","source_asin":"B00AA0QG58","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035688","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00AA0QG58","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00AA0QG58","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1035689,"name":"Irish Blessing Wall Decor, May The Road Rise Up to Meet You, Celtic Decor Home Blessing Sign, Irish Gifts for Women. Irish Wall Decor, House Warming P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.96,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61scIlwxWbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE IRISH BLESSING is a traditional Celtic poem passed down through the generations. The words portray the beauty of nature, wind, sun, and rain, to form the classic words of well wishes. It can be used for a wedding prayer or gift, home blessing for a new home gift, to say a sympathetic goodbye to a loved one or a going away present. This Irish decor can be used for any celebration as beautiful Christian home decor. THIS IRISH SAYING will be a perfect addition to your Ireland home decor and will make a beautiful wall decor grouping when added to your Celtic wall cross decor. Use as an entryway decoration for kitchen wall, home office or living room. IRISH BLESSING CELTIC WALL HANGING makes for great Christian decorations for home or spiritual wall decor. This Irish wall art makes for an inspirational house warming presents for women, memorial or funeral celebration of life photo frame, St Patricks Day decorations or a pastor appreciation gift. Also makes a great Christmas or birthday gift for a friend or family member. CELTIC DECOR or IRISH WALL DECOR BLESSING SAYS: \"May the road rise to meet you, May the wind be always at your back, May the sun shine warm upon your face, May the rain fall soft upon your fields, and until we meet again, May God hold you in the hollow of His hand.\" Details: Frames come in many color and size options and are available with or without the option to add your own photo to make it honor a special memory. This finished frame size is 10\"x10\" and holds an 8\"x8\" print. Each item is carefully packed in a custom-sized box with bubble wrap ensuring its safety during shipping. Proudly Made in the USA!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61scIlwxWbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Crossroads Home Décor","source_asin":"B08D83C6R4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035689","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08D83C6R4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08D83C6R4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1035690,"name":"Hydas Talking Alarm Clock, Silver","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SpHZuVK1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Now hear the time as well as see it; even in the dark!This extraordinary talking clock houses the most important features you need to get you started in the morning and keep you on track all day. A gentle voice clearly announces the time and day, whenever you press the VOICE/LIGHT BUTTON and it will announce the time hourly. Large easy to read characters on blue EL back lit LCD add to this alarm clock stylish appeal. . The beep beep alarm sounds for 2 minutes. If you press the VOICE button, you get 5 more minutes of sleep until you turn the ALARM SWITCH to off. For those with some vision, the time is displayed with large numbers and the date, indoor and outdoor temperatures are shown as well. The backlight comes on when the VOICE/LIGHT BUTTON is pushed. : Available languages: English, German, French, Italian, Japanese, and Spanish.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SpHZuVK1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hydas","source_asin":"B003J9R4YY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035690","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003J9R4YY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003J9R4YY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
