window.products.push({"id":1035780,"name":"Stand Mixer,Nidouillet 6.5 Quart Electric Mixer,6 Speed 660W Tilt-Head Kitchen Mixer with Dough Hook&Whisk,Food Mixer with Stainless Steel Bowl,Mixing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T+t0mvxyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"【6.5Qt Large Capacity Bowl】Our stand mixer comes with a 6.5Qt stainless steel bowl which can satisfy most of the daily use,Removable splatter guard helps not mess when add ingredients, let you enjoy preparing homemade dishes. 【660W Powerful Motor & 6 Speeds】660W high performance motor's Electric Stand Mixer, provides strong power for you,it also has long service Life.6 different speed provide set according to your need. 【3 in 1 Multipurpose Kitchen Mixer】 This Multifunctional household stand mixer is equipped with 3 different multiple attachments for all your food preparation needs. it is perfectly designed for you to do all types of food mixing, including creaming, beating, mixing, kneading, whipping.(And all the accessories can clean by dishwasher.) 【Easy To Use And Clean Up】Kitchen food stand mixer's attachments are easily secured to the shaft, dough hook, whisk, and beater which are easy to attach,The dough hook and paddle are solid metal, sturdy and durable.(Be careful not throw out attachments. ) 【Nidouillet After-sales Guarantee 】 We always strive to take the best sevice you and of your small kitchen stand mixer . And we offer a 45-day return refund guarantee, plus a 1-year warranty, on your stand mixer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61T+t0mvxyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nidouillet","source_asin":"B07WFP9DVR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07WFP9DVR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07WFP9DVR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1035781,"name":"Electype Instant Read Meat Thermometer Dual Probe Ultra Fast Best Waterproof Digital Food Meat Thermometer with Alarm Function and Backlight Calibrati","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AW9bvdphL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"🔥【Dual long safe high heat resistance probe】External wire probes with food-grade pressure-reducing dual probes to measure the internal temperature of meat when placed in the oven/grill/smoker. 42\" long metal wire can be used to track meat thermometer from outside of machine, rotating probe for meat/liquid, the original probe can only measure food after being removed from the machine.. Meat probes and wires can withstand temperatures from -58°F to 572°F (-50°C to 300°C). 🔥【Ultra-fast and accurate】Through the high quality sensor and stainless steel buck head, instantly read the thermometer temperature 2-3s, and in - Accurate to +/- 1 degree over a wide range of 58°F - 572°F. No need to wait for the stove or grill for the temperature to settle! Easy temperature reading even in the dark thanks to the bright backlit LCD display, ideal for turkey, steak, bread... Jam, chocolate, BBQ, hot milk and bath water. 🔥【TEMPERATURE ALARM SET】To manually preset the temperature of your favorite food.First,press ALARM SET briefly; Second,press and hold ºC. Finally,press \"Alarm Set\" again to complete the setting. Then , this oven-safe meat thermometer will beep to alert you when the desired temperature has been reached. It's especially smoker/oven/grill friendly, especially at Christmas or other occasions when rushing to make a family dinner Keeping people safe. 🔥【Easy to use and store】: open the rotary probe or plug the wire probe into the side socket to turn on the thermometer, fold or unplug it. The probe turns the thermometer off and the C / F key is held down for 2 seconds to switch between ºC/ºF. easy to store with excellent portability. Automatically turns off after 10 minutes of idle time. 🔥【Easy to carry and versatile】The oven thermometer with foldable probe is easy to fold and lock in the base for easy portability. It is suitable for all types of cooked beef, lamb, chicken, pork, fish, mutton or turkey. In addition, it can be used with beverages, frying, candy making and baking. (Note: Do not place the plastic thermometer in hot environments such as closed ovens, frying pans and grills after completing temperature readings) .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61AW9bvdphL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Electype","source_asin":"B08FMKVVY8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035781","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08FMKVVY8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08FMKVVY8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
