window.products.push({"id":1035897,"name":"RIMOO Top Fill Humidifiers for Bedroom Large Room, Super Easy Clean Humidifier with Only 3 Washable Parts to Clean, 1.3Gal 4.5L Ultrasonic Cool Mist H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+U1tgdc3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💧【Washable Tank of Ultrasonic Humidifier】Ultrasonic cool mist technology can quietly and safely moisten the air, which can better regulate air humidity, moisturize skin, reduce skin problems and relieve asthma. Patented separation design, with the separation of water and electricity, all parts in contact with water can be removed and cleaned, more clean and hygienic. 💧【4.5L Large Capacity】Holding up to 4.5L / 1.3 Gal water, cool mist humidifier allows for up to 48 hours of continuous use. With max mist output up to 300ml/h. The top fill cool mist humidifier provides two ways of water filling, either from the top water mist nozzle or directly from the water tank, easy to operate and avoid water dripping onto the desktop. Perfect ultrasonic humidifier for large rooms, bedrooms, baby nursery and office. 💧【3 Mist Levels & 4 Timer】This humidifier is easy to operate. Three touch buttons that control the switch, mist level (Low, Medium and High) and timer (2H/4H/8H/12H) respectively. Simply set the run time and mist level before going to bed or before work to effectively provide you with a comfortable environment. 360° mist nozzle: Easily direct the flow of mist away from areas that don't need moisture and toward the areas that do. 💧【Patented Silencing Design & Auto Shut-Off】Patented design of oscillator with muffler, below 25dB during operation allows you to sleep easily in a comfortable and quiet environment. Suspended oscillator head design, always keep the atomization piece in the water surface under 4 ~ 5 mm of the best atomization depth, when the suspension atomization head detects no water, all spray modes will be automatically turned off. Ensure the safety of your use. 💧【Long Service Life & Excellent Service】The atomization head can be replaced and repaired, which can increase the service life without expensive replacement of the whole machine. If you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. We promise to answer within 24 hours, we are willing to answer your questions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+U1tgdc3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RIMOO","source_asin":"B09CKS5CHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035897","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CKS5CHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CKS5CHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1035898,"name":"John Atkinson Aristocrat Cashmere and Lambs Wool Heirloom Blanket, King, 100-Inch by 109-Inch, Latte","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":648.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-ziVOM6fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The John Atkinson by Hainsworth® Aristocrat Lambswool & Cashmere blanket is made from a beautifully soft blend of 85-percent Lambswool and 15-percent Cashmere. This classic blanket is an ideal choice when you require a luxuriously soft blanket that is suitable for warmer months, too. Meticulously bound on all 4 sides, it is available in 4 sizes and two neutral colors to fit any décor. Woolen blankets are breathable, keeping you cool when it is hot and warm when it is cold, creating the ultimate sleeping environment. Crafted by a British mill founded in 1783, all blankets are manufactured from raw wool and hand finished, providing an heirloom quality blanket to be cherished for years to come. Browse the large collection of Atkinson wool blankets available here at Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91-ziVOM6fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"John Atkinson","source_asin":"B008718BBY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035898","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008718BBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008718BBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1035899,"name":"vv8oo Glass Teapot with Stainless Filter Tea Kettle Tea Kettle Stovetop Safe Blooming and Loose Leaf Tea Maker Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+7yuD+VxL._AC_UL1114_.jpg","description":"Heat-resistance from -20 to 150 degrees Celsius.The tea pot is stovetop safe, microwavable and dishwasher safe. You can put it directly on gas or electric stove tops with a medium level heat to heat water to brewing. This teapot comes with a removable infuser, which made with food grade stainless steel, very safe and easy to clean. Specification: Teapot material: High quality borosilicate glass Tea infuser material: 304 stainless steel Feature: Eco-friendly, Pb-free Capacity of tea pot: 32oz / 950ml ( to top the brim) Package content: 1 x glass teapot with infuser Usages: It can be used to make green tea, herbal tea, fruit tea and can also be used to make coffee, milk or other drinks you like. How to use this tea kettle: Drop right amount of loose leaf tea into the tea infuser; Pour boiled water carefully through the infuser into the teapot; The tea will gain colour and expand in the infuser; Tea can be drink after several minutes. NOTE: BE CAREFUL WITH HOT WATER! ABOUT SERVICE: If you received a defective product or unsatisfied with our loose leaf tea pot, please feel free to contact us. We will do our best to provide good after-sales service to give customers a better shopping experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+7yuD+VxL._AC_UL1114_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"vv8oo","source_asin":"B08MTSFS8G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035899","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08MTSFS8G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08MTSFS8G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
