window.products.push({"id":1035909,"name":"MadeTerra Wicker Pedestal Bowl | Seagrass Footed Fruit Bowls for Table Centerpiece - Decorative Baskets for Home Decor- Rustic Woven Wooden Bowls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Tibg-26S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERSATILE STORAGE & DECORATIVE BOWL - Our woven footed basket is a perfect bread basket or vegetables and fruit holder for your pantry and kitchen countertop. It is also a stylish key bowl for your farmhouse and could also help with organizing personal accessories ENDLESS DECOR CAPACITY - The beautiful color of the basket is made up by natural seagrass/hyacinth and so it doesn't fade after a long time in use. Meanwhile, its elegan vintage design, in combination adds a feel of rustic and height to your dining table. The fruit basket stand brings an instant charming farmhouse vibe to your home decor. By simply arranging some flowers on and scented candles around the decorative tray, you have already got for your dining table an impressive centerpiece! HANDMADE TO DETAILS - Our woven pedestal fruit stand is sophisticatedly handcrafted by skillful artisans. Every details is crafted with the utmost care. It is woven strongly to bear good amount of fruits, vegetables,... without deforming. The basket is coated with a transparent lacquer finish so it stays shiny and splinter-free. All to make sure this decorative wicker basket stays as good as new even after a long time in use PROTECTING MOTHER EARTH - Our woven footed basket is handmade from high quality seagrass a plant that is largely grown in Vietnam. The harvesting and processing of this plant leave little or no harmful impacts on the environment. We limited the use of chemicals during production. YOUR PURCHASE MAKES AN IMPACT- MadeTerra is a local maker-to-market company by artisans in Vietnam. This pedestal fruit basket is handcrafted by the very hands of skilled artisans in Kim Son, the base of sedge and seagrass in Vietnam. With every purchase you make, you are making a difference, contributing to global fair trade, supporting artisan communities and preserving the indigenous crafts and cultures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/810Tibg-26S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MadeTerra","source_asin":"B08Q7BYR8J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08Q7BYR8J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08Q7BYR8J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
