window.products.push({"id":1035923,"name":"Johalaide Goose Feather Down Comforter Queen Size, Polyester Fill Fluffy All Season Comforter Quilt Duvet Insert, Ultra-Soft 100% Cotton Fabric, Machi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911BKbjNVbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✦Ultra-soft & Lightweight -- Johalaide down alternative comforter is devoted to providing an extreme gentle and comfortable sleeping experience! Our alternative comforter with ultra-soft microfiber fabric is double brushed for extra softness, filled with a luxurious breathable polyester for high warmth retention. This microfiber comforter is fluffy and lightweight.This down alternative comforter is a great choice as a Christmas gift and Thanksgiving gift for family and friends. ✦Elegant & Quiet -- Simple but elegant design, can work as a duvet insert ,a stand-alone comforter or blanket, fits the various types of decoration, adding more beauty and coziness to your bedroom. Zero noise for sound sleep.Great choice for those who can't use goose down and feather bedding. ✦Premium Craftsmanship -- Our down alternative comforters feature elegant style box stitching and double-needle hemming which ensures an even distribution of warmth that no filling will bunch up , shift around or leak out. The 8 corner tabs make it extremely easy to put on duvet cover and secures the comforter in place. Exquisite hemming, durable and long lasting, perfect for year round use. ✦Machine Washable & Easy Care -- This microfiber comforter comes with hydrophilic fiber fill which makes it machine washable and easy to maintain.Machine washable by cold water and gentle cycle,no shrinkage or fade.To completely fluffy up this comforter, we suggest you expose the comforter in the sun for a few hours or put in the dryer before first using. ✦Customer Service -- We take Customers as our top priority.If for any reason in the first 30 days you are unsatisfied with quality of the item you received, you can return it with no reasons or asked in exchange for a new one. If you have any questions about the product, you can also contact us at any time, we will definitely give you a satisfactory answer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911BKbjNVbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Johalaide","source_asin":"B09CMBDYRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035923","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CMBDYRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CMBDYRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1035924,"name":"Pressure Sensitive Torque Activated Seals Cap Liners - 63mm (2.48\") - 25 PCS -Made in USA- for Glass & Plastic Bottles & Containers - No Induction Sea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kdYQGTKgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These polystyrene jar foam liner seals coated with torque-activated adhesive require no tools and no heat induction equipment. For proper application consider the following recommendations: ● Make sure your pressure sensitive liner size matches the jar opening.  These 63 mm (2.48 inches) seals are to be used with jars or bottles that measure slightly less than 63 mm in outer diameter neck size. ● Completely clean the jar top with clean cloth and alcohol to clear of liquid  and/or solids. Center jar seal on top of you plastic or glass jar, and apply. The white  side of the seal shall be facing down, the side with red letters shall be facing up. ● Screw metal or plastic cap on jar. Make sure the liner and cap are tightly secured on the container. ● Once the cap is applied, it should not be removed for at least 24 hours to ensure proper adhesion. Although depending on your application, the adhesion process might take significantly less time. ● Seals can be used with glass and plastic jars and with lined or unlined caps. These pressure sensitive liners are best for use with powder or dry products . ● Avoid overfilling your containers! ● Once seal is removed, it cannot be reapplied. ● Not suitable for applications containing oil.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kdYQGTKgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Advanced Girl","source_asin":"B086HTGQFL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1035924","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B086HTGQFL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B086HTGQFL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
